+Quick Search temporarily hides the top toolbar and softens the page behind the
+search field. Adjust **Appearance & glass → Quick Search background blur** from
+0 to 40 px; the search field, live results and keyboard remain sharp. An outside
+tap, Close or the existing dismiss swipe restores the toolbar and page. The
+listening-history Close button is at the top-left of its compact header. Its
+centered layout uses a readable row width and consistent artwork slots.
